#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How to use a virtual private endpoint to privately connect to IBM Quantum "
"Platform."
msgstr ""
"Como usar um endpoint privado virtual para se conectar de forma privada à "
"IBM Quantum Platform."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use virtual private endpoints for VPC to privately connect to IBM Quantum "
"Platform"
msgstr ""
"Use endpoints privados virtuais para VPC para se conectar de forma privada à"
" IBM Quantum Platform"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore FDQN */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore FDQN */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use virtual private endpoints for VPC to privately connect to IBM Quantum "
"Platform {#use-virtual-private-endpoints-for-vpc-to-privately-connect-to-"
"ibm-quantum-platform}"
msgstr ""
"Use endpoints privados virtuais para VPC para se conectar de forma privada à"
" IBM Quantum Platform {#use-virtual-private-endpoints-for-vpc-to-privately-"
"connect-to-ibm-quantum-platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Virtual Private Endpoints (VPE) for VPC to connect to IBM Quantum&reg; "
"from your VPC network by using IP address that you specify, allocated from a"
" subnet within your VPC.\n"
msgstr ""
"Use Virtual Private Endpoints (VPE) para VPC para se conectar à IBM "
"Quantum&reg; a partir da sua rede VPC usando um endereço IP que você "
"especifica, alocado a partir de uma sub-rede dentro da sua VPC.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"VPEs are virtual IP interfaces that are bound to an endpoint gateway created"
" on a per-service basis. The endpoint gateway is a virtualized function that"
" scales horizontally, is redundant and highly available, and spans all "
"availability zones of your VPC. Endpoint gateways enable communications from"
" virtual server instances within your VPC and IBM Cloud&reg; service on the "
"private backbone. VPE for VPC lets you control all private addressing within"
" your cloud. For more information, see [About virtual private endpoint "
"gateways](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-about-vpe).\n"
msgstr ""
"Os VPEs são interfaces IP virtuais vinculadas a um gateway de endpoint "
"criado por serviço. O gateway de endpoint é uma função virtualizada que "
"escala horizontalmente, é redundante e altamente disponível, e abrange todas"
" as zonas de disponibilidade da sua VPC. Os gateways de endpoint habilitam a"
" comunicação entre instâncias de servidor virtual dentro da sua VPC e o "
"serviço IBM Cloud&reg; no backbone privado. O VPE para VPC permite que você "
"controle todo o endereçamento privado dentro da sua nuvem. Para mais "
"informações, consulte [About virtual private endpoint "
"gateways](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-about-vpe).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Within IBM Quantum Platform, all customer data is transmitted over the "
"private network regardless of whether it is accessed through a public "
"endpoint or VPE.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dentro da IBM Quantum Platform, todos os dados do cliente são transmitidos "
"pela rede privada, independentemente de serem acessados por meio de um "
"endpoint público ou VPE.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Connecting to IBM Quantum Platform through the public endpoints transmits "
"all request and response data over the public internet. To connect to IBM "
"Quantum Platform by using a VPE, you must use the IBM Quantum Platform API "
"or SDK. IBM Quantum Platform can only be accessed through the public "
"network.\n"
msgstr ""
"Conectar-se à IBM Quantum Platform por meio dos endpoints públicos transmite"
" todos os dados de requisição e resposta pela internet pública. Para se "
"conectar à IBM Quantum Platform usando um VPE, você deve usar a API ou o SDK"
" da IBM Quantum Platform. A IBM Quantum Platform só pode ser acessada pela "
"rede pública.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Antes de começar {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before you target a VPE for IBM Quantum Platform, complete the following "
"steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Antes de direcionar um VPE para a IBM Quantum Platform, complete as "
"seguintes etapas:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create a Virtual Private Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"getting-started).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Crie uma Virtual Private Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"getting-started).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Plan for the network topology](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"planning-considerations) to connect to VPEs.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Planeje a topologia de rede](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"planning-considerations) para se conectar aos VPEs.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Set access controls](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-configure-"
"acls-sgs-endpoint-gateways) for your VPE.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Defina os controles de acesso](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"configure-acls-sgs-endpoint-gateways) para o seu VPE.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Understand the [limitations](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"limitations-vpe) of having a VPE.\n"
msgstr ""
"Entenda as [limitações](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"limitations-vpe) de ter um VPE.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Understand how to [view VPE "
"details](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-"
"endpoint-gateway).\n"
msgstr ""
"Entenda como [visualizar os detalhes do "
"VPE](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-"
"endpoint-gateway).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up a VPE for IBM Quantum Platform {#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-"
"platform}"
msgstr ""
"Configurar um VPE para a IBM Quantum Platform {#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-"
"quantum-platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are several ways to create a VPE gateway. If you use the "
"[CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpc-"
"reference&interface=cli#vpe-clis) or "
"[API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/vpc/latest#create-endpoint-gateway), you"
" must specify the [Cloud Resource Name "
"(CRN)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-crn) of the region "
"in which you want connect to IBM Quantum Platform. Review the following "
"table for the available regions and CRNs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Existem várias maneiras de criar um gateway VPE. Se você usar a "
"[CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpc-"
"reference&interface=cli#vpe-clis) ou a "
"[API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/vpc/latest#create-endpoint-gateway), "
"deverá especificar o [Cloud Resource Name "
"(CRN)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-crn) da região à "
"qual deseja se conectar à IBM Quantum Platform. Consulte a tabela a seguir "
"para ver as regiões e CRNs disponíveis.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Region | Plans   | Fully Qualified Domain Name (FDQN) | Cloud Resource Name (CRN) |\n"
"|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|\n"
"| `us-east` | `Standard` | `private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:us-east:::endpoint:private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
"| `eu-de` | `Standard` | `private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:eu-de:::endpoint:private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Região | Planos   | Nome de Domínio Totalmente Qualificado (FDQN) | Cloud Resource Name (CRN) |\n"
"|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|\n"
"| `us-east` | `Standard` | `private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:us-east:::endpoint:private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
"| `eu-de` | `Standard` | `private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:eu-de:::endpoint:private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring an endpoint gateway {#configuring-an-endpoint-gateway}"
msgstr ""
"Configurando um gateway de endpoint {#configuring-an-endpoint-gateway}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "To configure a VPE gateway, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr "Para configurar um gateway VPE, siga estas etapas:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List the available services, including IBM Cloud infrastructure services "
"available (by default) for all VPC users.\n"
msgstr ""
"Liste os serviços disponíveis, incluindo os serviços de infraestrutura do "
"IBM Cloud disponíveis (por padrão) para todos os usuários VPC.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create an endpoint gateway](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"ordering-endpoint-gateway) for IBM Quantum Platform that you want to be "
"privately available to the VPC.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Crie um gateway de endpoint](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"ordering-endpoint-gateway) para a IBM Quantum Platform que você deseja que "
"fique disponível de forma privada para a VPC.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Bind a reserved IP address](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-bind-"
"unbind-reserved-ip) to the endpoint gateway.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Vincule um endereço IP reservado](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"bind-unbind-reserved-ip) ao gateway de endpoint.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[View the created VPE gateways](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"vpe-viewing-details-of-an-endpoint-gateway) associated with IBM Quantum "
"Platform.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Visualize os gateways VPE "
"criados](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-"
"endpoint-gateway) associados à IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now your virtual server instances in the VPC can access your IBM Quantum "
"Platform instance privately.\n"
msgstr ""
"Agora suas instâncias de servidor virtual na VPC podem acessar sua instância"
" da IBM Quantum Platform de forma privada.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use your VPE for IBM Quantum Platform {#use-your-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-"
"platform}"
msgstr ""
"Use seu VPE para a IBM Quantum Platform {#use-your-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-"
"platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After you create an endpoint gateway for IBM Quantum Platform, follow these "
"steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Depois de criar um gateway de endpoint para a IBM Quantum Platform, siga "
"estas etapas:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the VPE with `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (Python SDK) {#use-the-vpe-with-"
"qiskit-ibm-runtime-python-sdk}"
msgstr ""
"Use o VPE com `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (SDK Python) {#use-the-vpe-with-qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime-python-sdk}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"VPE support requires `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.24.0 or later.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"O suporte a VPE requer `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.24.0 ou superior.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When instantiating `QiskitRuntimeService`, specify "
"`private_endpoint=True`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ao instanciar `QiskitRuntimeService`, especifique `private_endpoint=True`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the VPE with the IBM Quantum API {#use-the-vpe-with-the-ibm-quantum-api}"
msgstr ""
"Use o VPE com a API IBM Quantum {#use-the-vpe-with-the-ibm-quantum-api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After creating an endpoint gateway for IBM Quantum Platform, use the service"
" endpoint's FQDN for the target region.\n"
msgstr ""
"Depois de criar um gateway de endpoint para a IBM Quantum Platform, use o "
"FQDN do endpoint de serviço para a região de destino.\n"
